OL,3,GNEWSAOn frontline at hospital denying
OL,4,Aonline claims it is 'dangerous' and
OL,5,A'dreadful'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the #350m "super hospital" that
OL,8,Fhas been slammed as "dangerous" and a
OL,9,F"disgrace" on social media.
OL,11,FAt just six years old, the Grange
OL,12,FUniversity Hospital in Cwmbran has
OL,13,Falready come under fire for long
OL,14,Fdelays, overcrowding, staff shortages
OL,15,Fand the quality of its care.
OL,17,FBut senior staff insist it's one of the
OL,18,Fsafest in Wales on patient safety and
OL,19,Fsurvival rates.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
